OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with bright spells, the best
OL,7,Fof these in the south. Becoming cloudy
OL,8,Fin the west overnight with a few
OL,9,Fshowers. Dry with clear spells in the
OL,10,Feast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mixture of bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells and a few brief showers across
OL,14,Fthe west. Dry elsewhere. Light
OL,15,Fwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
